  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/pickupmanipulatormodule/text",
    "raw": "These useful gadgets are used to upgrade ^orange;tools^reset;, including your ^orange;Matter Manipulator^reset;, from the upgrade interface of your ^orange;Personal Tricorder^reset;. I suggest saving a few for when you build a ^green;Mining laser^reset;.",
    "value": "这些实用的小装置可用于升级^orange;工具^reset;，包括通过^orange;个人三度仪^reset;的升级界面来强化你的^orange;物质枪^reset;。建议你预留一些，以备日后制造^green;激光挖掘器^reset;时使用。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_pickupgravgun/text",
    "raw": "It appears you have obtained an upgrade to your ^cyan;Matter Manipulator^reset;. Using the ^orange;Shift + Secondary^reset; functionality of your ^green;Tricorder^reset;, you can replace your current device.",
    "value": "看起来你已获得升级版本的^cyan;物质枪^reset;。通过使用^green;三度仪^reset;的^orange;Shift+右键^reset;功能，你可以替换当前设备。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useFreud/text",
    "raw": "The ^orange;Instafreud^reset; reduces ^cyan;madness^reset;, helping even the most insane scientists come back from the worst possible mental traumas. It is the only guaranteed way to tame the voices in your head. You can also reduce Madness with crew, gear or consumables.",
    "value": "^orange;虚拟弗洛伊德^reset;能有效缓解^cyan;疯癫^reset;症状，即使是精神受创最严重的科学家也能借此从最糟糕的心理创伤中恢复。这是唯一能确保驯服你脑海中杂音的方法。此外，通过团队成员、装备或消耗品的使用，也能降低疯癫值。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useMarket/text",
    "raw": "The ^orange;Market^reset; provides a wealth of unique finds for sale to researchers and visitors alike, regardless of their affiliation. Some shopkeeps will provide quests from time to time, as well. I advise perusing every store : you never know what you'll find!",
    "value": "^orange;市场^reset;为研究人员和访客提供了大量独特的商品，无论他们来自何方。一些店主偶尔还会发布任务。我建议您仔细逛逛每一家店铺：说不定会有意想不到的发现！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useBooze/text",
    "raw": "The ^orange;Tavern^reset; provides entertainment and legal intoxicants to off-the-clock staff or visitors to the Science Outpost. While not all of us partake, some alcohol provides useful boons when ingested. After the ^orange;Tavern^reset; you'll find nothing of interest to investigate.",
    "value": "^orange;酒馆^reset;为科学前哨站的下班员工或访客提供娱乐及合法致醉品。虽然并非人人都会享用，但某些酒精饮品在摄入后能带来有益增益。过了^orange;酒馆^reset;区域，你将找不到任何值得探查的事物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useDrugs1/text",
    "raw": "Ah, the garbage area. What else needs to be said? One thing is for certain: you most assuredly have no interest in continuing further, past the next door. Nothing of use awaits. Just turn back and do not proceed. It's better that way.",
    "value": "啊，垃圾区。还有什么可说的呢？有一点可以肯定：你绝对不会有兴趣继续前进，穿过下一扇门。那里没有任何有用的东西等着你。不如转身回头，别再往前走了。这样更好。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useDrugs2/text",
    "raw": "So...you didn't listen. No worries. Whatever you do, do not speak with the X'i over there. He is not interesting or at all worth hanging out with. Not even a little. Ignore him. He doesn't have narcotics or illegal substances.",
    "value": "所以...你还是没听进去。没关系。无论如何，千万别和那边的艾肯搭话。这人无趣得很，完全不值得交往，一丁点儿都不值得。别理他。他手里没有毒品或违禁品。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useBees/text",
    "raw": "If you are an avid beekeeper, this is where you'll want to head to eschew yourself of excess Queens and Drones that do not meet your requirements. In exchange, you'll garner income and rare resources.",
    "value": "如果你是位狂热的养蜂人，这里正是你处理掉那些不符合要求的过剩蜂王和雄蜂的理想去处。通过交换，你将获得收入与稀有资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useKevin/text",
    "raw": "Nothing of interest lies below this point. You should definitely not proceed downward.",
    "value": "此处往下绝无任何趣味，建议你不必继续向下浏览。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useKevin2/text",
    "raw": "No good can come of going further. Turn back.",
    "value": "继续前行无益，回头是岸。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useKevin3/text",
    "raw": "Contrary to the poster on the wall, there will soon be a reason to be upset If you keep going. You might end up in a conversation with ^cyan;Kevin^reset;. This is best avoided for the rest of your natural life if you have any intent of remaining sane. You were warned.",
    "value": "与墙上的告示相反，如果你继续前行，很快就会有让你心烦意乱的理由。你可能会陷入与^cyan;凯文^reset;的对话中。若你还想保持理智，余生最好都避免这种情况。特此提醒。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useStarbucks/text",
    "raw": "Yes, we have a ^orange;Starbucks^reset;. It's been here as long as anyone remembers: We cannot find the agreement we signed, nor have Starbucks been able to do so, that led to it being set up here. We have simply learned to accept it. ^cyan;Kevin^reset; without caffeine is not a thing you want to see.",
    "value": "是的，我们这儿有一家^orange;星八克^reset;。它存在的时间久到无人记得起：我们找不到当初签署的协议，星八克方面也未能提供，它就这样在这里落户咯。我们只是学会了接受它的存在。毕竟，没有咖啡因的^cyan;凯文^reset;，那可不是你想见到的样子。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useBathroom/text",
    "raw": "Various species expel their waste within this room. Except ^cyan;Kevin^reset;. Nobody has any clue where he goes to the bathroom, but he has never once used this facility other than as temporary storage for large carnivorous reptiles. ^cyan;Kevin^reset; maintains that this was necessary.",
    "value": "各类生物都在此室内排泄废物，除了^cyan;凯文^reset;。无人知晓他究竟在何处解决如厕问题，但他从未使用过这个设施，除了偶尔将其用作大型肉食爬行动物的临时存放处。^cyan;凯文^reset;坚称这是必要的安排。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useMusicAward/text",
    "raw": "^cyan;Kevin^reset; insists he was given this award for the best-selling album of all time among Mantizi culture :^yellow;'Holy Crap, Look At The Size of that Sandwich!'^reset;. No proof has ever been provided. It is best to assume this is bullshit.",
    "value": "^cyan;凯文^reset;坚称，他因甲虫族文化史上最畅销专辑：^yellow;《天哪，看看那个三明治有多大！》^reset;而获此奖项。但他从未提供任何证据。最好还是认为这纯属胡扯。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/fu_useTrough/text",
    "raw": "^orange;Troughs^reset; provide a place to store food for your farm animals. When one of them becomes hungry, they will seek food there. With enough food they'll become happy, which increases their chance to produce offspring if a viable mate is nearby!",
    "value": "^orange;食槽^reset;为你的农场动物提供了储存食物的地方。当它们感到饥饿时，便会前往食槽觅食。充足的食物能让它们保持愉悦，若附近有合适的伴侣，这将提高它们繁衍后代的几率！"
  }
]